#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:4
msgid ""
"LMCache MP clients select the request transport from the LMCache server "
"URL. This transport carries control and cache-operation requests; it is "
"separate from ``--supported-transfer-mode``, which controls how KV data "
"moves between the engine worker and the LMCache server."
msgstr ""

