#: ../../source/mp/request_transport.rst:33
msgid ""
"The protobuf schemas for the planned gRPC transport live under "
"``lmcache/v1/multiprocess/transport/grpc_impl/protos``. Package builds "
"generate their Python bindings under the sibling ``_proto_gen`` package. "
"Landing these schemas and the build-time generator does not enable the "
"gRPC client or server; ``grpc://`` endpoints remain unavailable until the"
" runtime implementation lands."
msgstr ""

